---
import Icon from '../../components/Icon.astro';
import { execution, phases, branchNames, branchLabels, branchRecord, answerText } from './model';
import './branches.css';
const original=branchRecord('balanced');
---
<section class="bl" data-branch-lab data-phase="0" aria-labelledby="bl-title">
  <div class="bl-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">Recorded execution / interactive replay</p><h2 id="bl-title">The Sunday Studio</h2></div><p>Follow one reference through two edits. The answers are deterministic fixture text; no model inference took place.</p></div>
  <ol class="bl-steps" aria-label="Recorded workflow steps">{phases.map((phase,i)=><li><button type="button" data-step={i} aria-current={i===0?'step':undefined} disabled><span>0{i+1}</span>{phase.label}</button></li>)}</ol>
  <div class="bl-story"><div><p class="eyebrow" data-step-label>01 / Reference</p><h3 data-stage-title>{phases[0].title}</h3><p data-stage-copy>{phases[0].copy}</p></div><button type="button" class="bl-next" data-next disabled><span>{phases[0].action}</span><Icon name="arrow-right" /></button></div>
  <div class="bl-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"><Icon name="check" /><p data-status>{phases[0].status}</p><span data-count>Reference ready</span></div>
  <div class="bl-gallery" data-gallery><div class="bl-print"><img data-gallery-image src="/media/studio/sample-print.png" width="1080" height="1080" alt="Sunday Studio poster with a flowing green arc and cream typography" /></div><div><p class="eyebrow">The actual exported reference</p><h3>A small adventure.</h3><p>A fictional Sunday Studio poster, made with the real Studio Lab renderer. The same file becomes image #1 in the isolated PanelForge run.</p><span class="bl-image-label"><Icon name="image" /> One image, carried through the work</span></div></div>
  <div class="bl-workspace" data-workspace hidden>
    <article class="bl-shared"><img data-shared-image src="/media/studio/sample-print.png" width="1080" height="1080" alt="The same Sunday Studio reference retained by every branch" /><div><p class="eyebrow">Shared beginning / 2 messages + the same image</p><h3>The part every direction keeps.</h3><details><summary>Read the opening exchange <Icon name="plus" /></summary><p class="bl-quote"><span>Opening request</span>{original.messages[0].content}</p><p class="bl-quote"><span>Fixture answer</span>{answerText(original.messages[1].content)}</p></details></div><span class="bl-retained"><Icon name="check" /> Reference retained</span></article>
    <div class="bl-connectors" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 900 50" preserveAspectRatio="none"><path d="M450 0V20M150 50V20H750V50M450 20V50" /></svg></div>
    <div class="bl-branches" role="group" aria-label="Recorded conversation directions">{branchNames.map((name,i)=><button type="button" data-branch={name} aria-pressed={name==='balanced'} disabled={i>0}><span class="bl-branch-order">0{i+1} / {i===0?'Original':'Revision'}</span><strong>{branchLabels[name]}</strong><span class="bl-branch-detail">{name==='balanced'?'The starting direction':name==='bold'?'A larger headline':'More room to breathe'}</span><span class="bl-preferred" data-preferred-badge hidden><Icon name="check" /> Preferred</span></button>)}</div>
    <div class="bl-result-head"><p class="eyebrow" data-result-heading>Original direction</p><button type="button" class="bl-compare-toggle" data-compare disabled><Icon name="arrow-both" /> Compare Bold and Quiet</button></div>
    <div class="bl-results" data-results>{branchNames.map(name=><article class="bl-result" data-result={name} hidden={name!=='balanced'}><header><h3>{branchLabels[name]} direction</h3><span data-result-preferred hidden><Icon name="check" /> Recorded preferred</span></header><p class="bl-quote"><span>{name==='balanced'?'Original brief':'Revised brief'}</span>{branchRecord(name).messages[2].content}</p><p class="bl-quote bl-answer"><span>Fixture answer</span>{answerText(branchRecord(name).messages[3].content)}</p><footer><Icon name="check" /> Same opening exchange. Same input image.</footer></article>)}</div>
  <div class="bl-choice" data-choice hidden><button type="button" data-prefer>Replay Quiet as preferred <Icon name="check" /></button><p data-choice-status>The recorded choice keeps the other directions available.</p></div>
  </div>
  <div class="bl-proof-strip"><div><span>Original messages</span><strong data-original-proof>Preservation checked in the run</strong></div><div><span>Recorded result</span><strong>3 connected directions</strong></div><div><span>Model inference</span><strong>None</strong></div></div>
  <noscript><div class="bl-noscript"><h3>The recorded outcome</h3><p>The original four messages remained unchanged. Two edits created Bold and Quiet branches, each retaining the same opening exchange and image. Quiet became preferred.</p><p>The recording and public receipt below remain readable without JavaScript.</p></div></noscript>
  <details class="bl-inspect"><summary>Inspect the preserved links and source <Icon name="plus" /></summary><div class="bl-inspect-grid"><div><h3>A family with a shared beginning</h3><table><caption>Fictional fixture conversations, actual database links</caption><thead><tr><th>Direction</th><th>Conversation</th><th>Root</th><th>Fork point</th></tr></thead><tbody>{branchNames.map(name=><tr><th>{branchLabels[name]}</th><td>#{branchRecord(name).id}</td><td>#{branchRecord(name).root_conversation_id??branchRecord(name).id}</td><td>{branchRecord(name).forked_at_message_id?`Message #${branchRecord(name).forked_at_message_id}`:'Original'}</td></tr>)}</tbody></table><p>Two actual fork responses returned 202. Both copied the first two messages and image #1. The original four message rows matched their snapshot from before either edit.</p><a href="/media/branches/receipt.json" class="text-link">Read the public execution receipt <Icon name="arrow-up-right" /></a></div><div><h3>The source and the substitutes</h3><p>The actual Vue interface, Laravel fork controller, fork service, message/image models, preference endpoint and tree ran in a fresh local fixture.</p><p>Initial answers came from a deterministic local SSE fixture. Forks used the native dispatch-skip option; branch replies were seeded. Browser reloads observed persisted state while queue workers and broadcasting were disabled.</p><p>The comparison view required a one-line API-envelope fix. Its mounted regression failed before the patch, then both envelope and direct-payload tests passed. Real app comparison also rendered at phone, tablet and desktop sizes.</p><dl><dt>Base source</dt><dd><code>{execution.source.baseRevision}</code></dd><dt>Tested local source</dt><dd><code>{execution.source.testedRevision}</code></dd><dt>Comparison patch</dt><dd>Committed locally; unreleased</dd></dl></div></div></details>
</section>
<script>import { initBranches } from './controller';document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('[data-branch-lab]').forEach(initBranches);</script>
